---
import { getImage } from 'astro:assets';
import andyPhoto from '../../assets/andy.png';
import audioSrc from '../../assets/loc_student_quote.mp3?url';
import StudentCard from '../StudentCard.astro';

const photo = await getImage({ src: andyPhoto, format: 'webp' });

// Paste the opening student pull quote here.
const quote = '"Organizations change all the time across every industry"';
---

<StudentCard
  storyTitle="LOC"
  studentName="Andy Grossman, LOC ’22"
  image={{ src: photo.src, alt: 'Portrait of Andy' }}
  quote={quote}
  audioSrc={audioSrc}
>
  <Fragment slot="transcript">
    <p>I think I was struggling a little bit with Econ, where it's, like, I felt like I was getting quantitative through my Econ classes, but I felt like I wanted to do a little bit more collaboration.</p>
    <p>Obviously, Econ is very — there's a lot of tangible work that comes with it and understanding of how markets work and whatnot, and I think that's all crucial, but I think that all of the lessons I learned through LOC and through SESP really apply because <strong>organizations change all the time across every industry</strong>.</p>
  </Fragment>
</StudentCard>
